# NOT the compiled-assets directory above -- tests/Unit/Build/ is a PHPUnit
# test namespace (WP.org T4 Phase B, Task B-A1's NoProFeatureAssetsTest.php).
# `build/` has no leading slash, so with core.ignorecase=true (this repo's
# Windows checkouts) it also matches any path ending in a case-insensitive
# "build" segment, including this one; un-ignore it explicitly.
!tests/Unit/Build/
!tests/Unit/Build/**
# A11a moved reports / messages / export / vendor-reports / vendor-management to
# the Pro add-on. Their un-ignore lines were removed in 5.2.1: with the sources
